    <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-384" contextRef="c-02">&lt;p&gt;As of December 31, 2025, Silver Run Electric, LLC was controlled by its sole member Silver Run Holdings, LLC, which was controlled by its sole member LS Power Grid DRS Holdings, LLC, which was controlled indirectly by LS Power Development, LLC as general partner of LS Power Associates, L.P.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="f-386" contextRef="c-02">&lt;p&gt;2. None&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
