    <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-389" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. The following occurred during the reporting period ending December 31, 2025:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shimon Edelstein removed as Executive Vice President, Tax;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Joseph Esteves appointed Executive Vice President;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Douglas Mulvey removed as Vice President, Development and appointed Vice President;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Matthew Popp removed as Vice President, Transmission and appointed Vice President;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lawrence Willick removed as Executive Vice President.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
