width: 2.5pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.8pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 46.3pt; border-top: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 1.5pt double rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.8pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;21,631&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-right: 0.9pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-inside: avoid; line-height: 102%"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; text-align: left; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;(6)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 14.52pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Leases&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; page-break-after: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company has operating leases for land and buildings under various terms as noted below. The Company has certain agreements that contain renewal options. The intent to renew a lease varies depending on the lease type and asset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Renewal options that are reasonably certain to be exercised are included in the lease term. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 4.6pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-inside: avoid; line-height: 102%"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company entered into non&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;cancellable operating leases for office and maintenance facilities. Effective March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;10, 2020, the Company has a five&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;year lease for approximately 4,500 square feet of office and warehouse space. This lease includes an option for up to two successive renewal terms of five&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;years each. Effective August&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;26, 2020, the Company has a five&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;year ground lease agreement for approximately five acres for a materials yard. Effective March 21, 2025, the Company renewed the office and warehouse lease for an additional five-year term beginning July 1, 2025. Effective April 22, 2025, the Company renewed the ground lease for an additional twelve-month term beginning September 1, 2025.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 0.7pt 0 27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Lease payments are payable on a monthly basis. Lease payments under certain agreements may escalate over the lease term by a fixed percentage. The Company does not have any leases that contain variable lease&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 0.7pt 0 27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;payments. The Company has no leases which contain residual value guarantees provided by the Company.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0.7pt; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 0 0.7pt 0 27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the operating lease cost and related cash flows are as follows (in thousands):&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 503.75pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; border-collapse: collapse" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 27pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 295.2pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 16.2pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 2pt; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 61.2pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 11.7pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 65.45pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 295.2pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vert