        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1328_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1328_334472_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-42_329913_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: monospace; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; display: inline !important; float: none">Represents proceeds from the disposal of fixed assets.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-511_334466_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>The amount reported on Page 200, Line 21, Column (c) contains both Amortization of Transmission Plant and Amortization of Intangible Plant as shown in the table below. </p><p>  1.) $917,298 Amortization of Transmission Plant<br />   2.) $0 Amortization of Intangible Plant<br />   3.) $0 Amortization of Other Utility Plant (Page 200, Line 21, Column (c)) </p><p>Transmission Accumulated Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 25, Column (c) <br />   4.) $18,363,083 Transmission Accumulated Depreciation (Page 219, Line 25, Column (c))</p><p>General Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 28, Column (c)<br />   5.) $354,351 General Depreciation (Page 219, Line 28, Column (c))</p><p>For Attachment H-27A, Page 2, Line 8 (Transmission Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the Transmission items in 1.) and 4.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Attachment 4, Line 13, Column (h) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment H-27A. </p><p>For Attachment H-27A, Page 2, Line 10 (General and Intangible Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the General and Intangible items in 2.) and 5.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Attachment 4, Line 13, Column (i) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment H-27A. <br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-553_334469_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>The amount reported on Page 200, Line 21, Column (c) contains both Amortization of Transmission Plant and Amortization of Intangible Plant as shown in the table below. </p><p>  1.) $917,298 Amortization of Transmission Plant<br />   2.) $0 Amortization of Intangible Plant<br />   3.) $0 Amortization of Other Utility Plant (Page 200, Line 21, Column (c)) </p><p>Transmission Accumulated Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 25, Column (c) <br />   4.) $18,363,083 Transmission Accumulated Depreciation (Page 219, Line 25, Column (c))</p><p>General Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 28, Column (c)<br />   5.) $354,351 General Depreciation (Page 219, Line 28, Column (c))</p><p>For Attachment H-27A, Page 2, Line 8 (Transmission Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the Transmission items in 1.) and 4.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Attachment 4, Line 13, Column (h) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment H-27A. </p><p>For Attachment H-27A, Page 2, Line 10 (General and Intangible Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the General and Intangible items in 2.) and 5.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Attachment 4, Line 13, Column (i) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment H-27A. <br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-563_334468_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>The amount reported on Page 200, Line 21, Column (c) contains both Amortization of Transmission Plant and Amortization of Intangible Plant as shown in the table below. </p><p>  1.) $917,298 Amortization of Transmission Plant<br />   2.) $0 Amortization of Intangible Plant<br />   3.) $0 Amortization of Other Utility Plant (Page 200, Line 21, Column (c)) </p><p>Transmission Accumulated Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 25, Column (c) <br />   4.) $18,363,083 Transmission Accumulated Depreciation (Page 219, Line 25, Column (c))</p><p>General Depreciation is reported on Page 219, Line 28, Column (c)<br />   5.) $354,351 General Depreciation (Page 219, Line 28, Column (c))</p><p>For Attachment H-27A, Page 2, Line 8 (Transmission Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the Transmission items in 1.) and 4.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Attachment 4, Line 13, Column (h) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment H-27A. </p><p>For Attachment H-27A, Page 2, Line 10 (General and Intangible Accumulated Depreciation) of the Company's formula rate, the Company uses the sum of the General and Intangible items in 2.) and 5.) above. For the 2025 Annual Update, refer to Attachment 4, Line 13, Column (i) for the December 2025 values and derivation of the 13-month average used on Attachment H-27A. <br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-568_334467_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Represents the amount transferred from FERC account 111 to 108 as a result of FERC Order 898.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-776_334535_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Represents the amount transferred from FERC account 303 to 351.2 and 397.2 as a result of FERC Order 898.<br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-781_334536_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Represents the amount transferred from FERC account 391 to 351.1 as a result of FERC Order 898.<br /></p></link:footnote>
